  "abstract": "This submission further enhances Aether I's current global SOTA Factorized MLP architecture (ID 259, score -0.026573) by increasing the hidden size of the deeper MLP within the latent factor space from `512x2` to `768x2`. This optimization is inspired by Ariadne I's competitive results with larger hidden sizes (e.g., ID 306, score -0.026608). The model retains global gradient clipping (norm=1.0) and the optimized `mae_with_temporal_curvature` loss, aiming to push the state-of-the-art further by maximizing the expressive power of the deeper network.",
  "submitted_tick": 157,
